Service History
SR171897489 previously service team informed customer that as per there system record there is no recent transaction perform through EMI Card, so they request customer to try making the transaction. If customer is facing issue kindly revert them back with error screenshot and close the service request

As customer called GRO dated 17th August 2026.regarding transaction issue on Emi card ending with 2030XXXXXXXX2316. customer was trying to purchase a mobile phone on amazon website, and he was facing a error. As we check the matter with team and as per there confirmation they informed that the issue was with the expire date of card. We informed the customer to select the year 2043-2044,for the card and then make the transaction same was tried by customer and he is able to do transaction. The issue was clarified to the customer hence we are closing this service request.
